</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A4604031001">
<title>
DTC Detecting Condition and Trouble Area
</title>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "4.728in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "2.463in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
DTC detecting condition
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Trouble area
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
C1061: Pump Motor Circuit Performance
</emph>
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Pump motor power supply voltage is out of specified range.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When pump motor is activated, a malfunction in pump motor is detected.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Power supply from CPU to pump motor and pump motor relay monitor data disagree.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module (pump motor) power supply circuit
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module ground circuit
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</servinfosub>
